<p>You lean to alter chaotic forces to your advantage.</p><p>Your maximum negative insanity effect is reduced from 50% to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">48%, 41%, 37%, 34%, 31%.</acronym></p><p>You may activate this talent to consume any Chaos Orbs you have, gaining 10 insanity per orb.</p>